        "text": "Now restore the two decimal places.\\n\\nWhole-number L.C.M. = 630\\n\\nRestore 2 decimal places:\\n\\n630 → 6.30\\n\\nTherefore:\\n\\nL.C.M. of 0.63, 1.05 and 2.1 = 6.30\\n\\nThe book writes this as 6.30, which is equal in value to 6.3.",
