      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Now switch back to L.C.M. with the book's example:\\n\\n3, 2.7 and 0.09\\n\\nMake the decimal places equal:\\n\\n3.00, 2.70 and 0.09\\n\\nRemove decimal points:\\n\\n300, 270 and 9\\n\\nThe book gives L.C.M. of these whole numbers as 2700. Restore the two decimal places.",
