      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's complete the chain carefully:\\n\\n3.00, 2.70, 0.09\\n→ 300, 270, 9\\n→ L.C.M. = 2700\\n→ restore 2 decimal places\\n→ 27.00\\n\\nThe book writes:\\n27.00 = 27\\n\\nSo the final answer is 27.",
