      "content": {
        "text": "If the equalized inputs use two decimal places, the result must also be written with two decimal places.\\n\\n35 → 0.35\\n\\nThat is why the book's H.C.F. examples do not finish with 35 or 18; they finish with 0.35 or 0.18.",
